0 G-03 LEGAL: the 5-plate / 2-stud identity, 40 LDU either way.
0 Left: five 1x1 plates stacked, 5 x 8 = 40 LDU tall.
0 Right: one 1x2 plate stood on edge, 2 x 20 = 40 LDU tall.
0 The two columns are exactly the same height. That equality is what lets a
0 sideways sub-assembly rejoin the upright grid.
